#: ../../source/combined-stream_Readme.md:1
msgid "combined-stream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/combined-stream_Readme.md:3
msgid "A stream that emits multiple other streams one after another."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/combined-stream_Readme.md:5
msgid ""
"**NB** Currently `combined-stream` works with streams version 1 only. "
"There is ongoing effort to switch this library to streams version 2. Any "
"help is welcome. :) Meanwhile you can explore other libraries that "
"provide streams2 support with more or less compatibility with `combined-"
"stream`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/combined-stream_Readme.md:7
msgid ""
"[combined-stream2](https://www.npmjs.com/package/combined-stream2): A "
"drop-in streams2-compatible replacement for the combined-stream module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/combined-stream_Readme.md:9
msgid ""
"[multistream](https://www.npmjs.com/package/multistream): A stream that "
"emits multiple other streams one after another."
msgstr ""

